#!RuleTest
#test DRAFT-900022 expect=noViolation domain=VS
#note "Library declares VSPOS with NO ccode (variable-metadata line without a ccode key, no codelist); define binds ccode=C99999. The not empty(var_ccode(\"LIBRARY\")) guard excludes variables without a library codelist expectation -> silent. Encodes the guard as intent (per the rule's ExecutabilityHint), not incidental behavior. VSLAT carries a matching library/define ccode pair so it does not confound the isolation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library variable-metadata VS VSPOS codelist=C71148
#library variable-metadata VS VSLAT codelist=C99074 ccode=C99074
#define domain-variables VS VSTESTCD:Topic VSPOS:Qualifier VSLAT:Qualifier
#define variable-metadata VS VSPOS ccode=C99999
#define variable-metadata VS VSLAT ccode=C99074
#define variable-metadata VS VSTESTCD ccode=C66741
dataset VS class=FINDINGS
col USUBJID  type=Char
col VSTESTCD type=Char
col VSPOS    type=Char
col VSLAT    type=Char
---
001 | SYSBP | SUPINE | LEFT
---
